# UX workflow: resize a non-flat automation window.
# Purpose: validates that shortening Length acts as a playback window and that
# extending it again re-exposes the original source curve instead of losing data.

0 scenario macro-automation-curve-shape
80 capture screen macro_grid_curve_source

# Open Macro Edit for Macro 1.
180 button MACRO_1 down
1280 tick
1360 capture screen macro_1_edit_detail
1460 button MACRO_1 up

# Open Automation detail and focus Length.
1620 encoder NAV 1
1780 tap NAV 60
2020 capture screen macro_1_automation_detail
2180 encoder NAV 1

# Shorten the active window.
2340 encoder OPT -1.00
2580 capture screen macro_1_automation_window_short

# Extend again. The curve preview should recover the source shape.
2740 encoder OPT 1.00
2900 encoder OPT 1.00
3140 capture screen macro_1_automation_window_extended
